description	"Trandoshan Boxer

^2Weapons:
- Heavy Fisticuffs

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) [Tip: You can climb blocks by using this wisely]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS2 Melee]

They call themselves boxers, but truthfully these guys just forgot to bring any weapons."